---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/layout/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { INDEPENDENCE } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Funding & Advertising Disclosure" description="How Standby Generator Guide separates editorial decisions from programmatic advertising, affiliate links, sponsorships, rankings, and installer or dealer payments.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ href: '/', label: 'Home' }, { label: 'Funding & Advertising Disclosure' }]} />
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold text-primary">Who pays for the advice?</h1>
    <div class="prose-hgg mt-6">
      <p><strong>Current status:</strong> Standby Generator Guide currently displays no live affiliate links or advertising. Our guides are free to read, and we do not sell generators or installation leads.</p>
      <h2>Our independence commitment</h2>
      <p>{INDEPENDENCE}</p>
      <p>We do not accept direct payments from generator brands, dealers, or installers for favorable editorial coverage, sponsored rankings, product placement inside editorial conclusions, or suppression of limitations. No company can pay to become our recommended option.</p>
      <h2>Programmatic advertising</h2>
      <p>If we enable a third-party advertising network such as Google AdSense, the ad network may select and serve ads based on page context, geography, consent choices, or other signals it is permitted to use. An advertiser appearing beside an article does not sponsor, review, approve, or influence that article.</p>
      <p>Programmatic advertising revenue is kept separate from our research process. Editorial staff do not change rankings, comparisons, model coverage, safety caveats, or conclusions to satisfy an advertiser.</p>
      <h2>No referral commissions</h2>
      <p>We do not receive generator-brand, dealer, or installer referral fees. We do not sell your contact information to installers or steer your choice toward a company that pays us.</p>
      <h2>Any future funding must meet the same standard</h2>
      <p>If the way this site is funded changes, we will disclose it here and at the point where it matters to readers. Funding cannot buy editorial conclusions, remove documented limitations, or change the evidence standard used in comparisons.</p>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>Read our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a> or <a href="/contact/">contact us</a> about a potential conflict. You deserve to know whose interests an article serves.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
